              "do": "note",
              "text": "In a fraction power the bottom is the root: $a^{\\frac{1}{n}}=\\sqrt[n]{a}$",
              "near": "b4",
              "on": "tells us which"
            },
            { "do": "write", "token": "c4", "on": "Two over seven" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "say": "Now the power three outside the bracket. Same power: every base inside the bracket gets the power three.",
          "asks": ["Why does every base get the power?", "Which law is this?"],
          "do": [
            { "do": "highlight", "token": "a4", "tone": "orange" },
            { "do": "write", "token": "a5", "on": "every base inside" },
            {
              "do": "note",
              "text": "Same power: $\\left(\\frac{a}{bc}\\right)^3=\\frac{a^3}{b^3c^3}$",
              "near": "a5",
              "on": "the power three"
            }
          ]
